  "claim_short": "The source says that irreducibility of its complex incidence variety I_{k_1,...,k_N,M} is not known. Irreducibility is false in the allowed rank-one case. If every k_i=1, then the incidence variety has exactly 2^N irreducible components. The components are indexed by choosing, for each projected line, whether that line is orthogonal to x or to y.",
